   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Worked cell i=5 (value 7):\nsmaller elements to the left: 2, 5, 3\ntheir dp: 1, 2, 2 -> best is 2\ndp[5] = 2+1 = 3, par[5] = 3 (the 5)\n\nWorked cell i=6 (value 101):\neverything is smaller, best dp before = 3\ndp[6] = 4, par[6] = 5 (the 7)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "originalText": "Worked cell i=5 (value 7):\nsmaller elements to the left: 2, 5, 3\ntheir dp: 1, 2, 2 -> best is 2\ndp[5] = 2+1 = 3, par[5] = 3 (the 5)\n\nWorked cell i=6 (value 101):\neverything is smaller, best dp before = 3\ndp[6] = 4, par[6] = 5 (the 7)",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
